  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian mine action incl. survey and clearance, and mine risk education for affected populations. Risks from mines, cluster munitions, and other explosive weapons in affected countries are reduced to a level where civilians can live safely and development is not constrained.</narrative>
